<p><a name="footnote2"></a><sup>2 </sup>College Board, 2013.<a href="http://trends.collegeboard.org/college-pricing"> Trends in College Pricing</a>, last accessed February 5, 2015.</p>
<p><a name="footnote3"></a><sup>3 </sup>Dynarski, Susan and Daniel Kreisman, 2013. &ldquo;Loans for Edicational Opportunity: Making Borrowing Work for Today&rsquo;s Students,&rdquo; Hamilton Project Working Paper, October.    </div>
         

